Sorry for bumping this further, but I've found the proximate cause of the convergence issue (all the columns were, in fat, sorted correctly).

Originally, when the model "worked", I had 4 sampling periods per season. Well, I thought period 2 didn't add much information, as the sampling was much less intense and therefore had many NAs. So, I took out Period 2 a few weeks ago.

However, I have found I can "fix" the convergence issue simply by adding the sparse Period 2 data! It seems as though this is the only covariate impacted, which I find interesting!

Anyway, thanks again, Jim!
